        <mxCell id="23" value="Look how simple Step 2 is:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Take all 64 bytes of K₀&lt;br&gt;• XOR every byte with hex 0x36 (binary 00110110)&lt;br&gt;• Example Byte 0:  0x4B ⊕ 0x36 = 0x7D   |   Zero pad bytes: 0x00 ⊕ 0x36 = 0x36&lt;br&gt;• Output: 64-byte Inner Key (Si)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F5F7;strokeColor=#D0D5DD;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E2226;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="448" y="68" width="660" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
